#### 1. **Pipeline-Level Timeout**

You can set a global timeout for the entire pipeline using the `timeout` option in the `options` block of your Jenkinsfile. This ensures that the entire pipeline will be aborted if it exceeds the specified time.

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

