#### 2. **Stage-Level Timeout**

You can also set a timeout for individual stages within the pipeline. This is useful if you want to ensure that specific stages do not exceed a certain duration.

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                checkout scm
            }
        }

        stage('Setup Environment') {
