### Conclusion

This Jenkins pipeline script sets up a basic CI/CD pipeline that uses Docker for building and testing your sensor application. By following this structure, you can ensure that your code is tested in a consistent environment and deployed reliably. Adjust the script according to your specific needs, such as adding more complex testing steps or integrating with other services like Kubernetes for deployment.

